WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.090
- So I heard, I was reading
the pre-interview for this,

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:06.227
I had no idea that y'all
opened for me in 2005.

00:00:06.227 --> 00:00:09.047
'Cause I feel like I just got really cool.

00:00:09.047 --> 00:00:09.880
(laughing)

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.870
- No, so no one cared about us in 2005.

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:15.342
We were just coming up and
basically to get other gigs,

00:00:15.342 --> 00:00:18.260
we listed the other acts
that we'd opened up for,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.839
but that really just meant
- I love that.

00:00:19.839 --> 00:00:21.900
- That we were on the outside
stage in the parking lot

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.591
while you were playing for 40,000 people.

00:00:23.591 --> 00:00:25.020
- Still the same.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.805
- But you helped us get
a lot of gigs after that.

00:00:26.805 --> 00:00:27.650
- Oh my God.
- So thank you.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.507
We owe you 20%.

00:00:28.507 --> 00:00:31.480
(laughing)

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.080
- So, now you're on tour for real.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.587
So tell us about Happiness Begins.

00:00:35.587 --> 00:00:38.860
- Yeah so this has been
quite the crazy year

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:39.693
for the family.

00:00:39.693 --> 00:00:41.534
Just a year ago right now,

00:00:41.534 --> 00:00:46.165
we had just started recording
music together again

00:00:46.165 --> 00:00:50.353
and looking a year later we're
finishing up the first leg

00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:55.353
of a crazy tour and also
the album Happiness Begins.

00:00:55.938 --> 00:00:57.680
But it all started with the documentary,

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.030
which we called "Chasing Happiness"

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:01.580
which was kind of just to tell
our story of our childhood.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.790
You know, our father was a pastor

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:06.090
and we had a pretty crazy
journey in the church

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.790
and then into our music career together

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:10.770
and we had really no intention

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.880
of getting the band back together.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.670
But after filming for a little while

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:17.020
and kind of healing some
of those family wounds

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:18.240
that were there from our years

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.700
of working together in the past,

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.680
we were able to look at
this with a fresh view

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.680
and really kind of all in
different ways find our happiness.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:27.930
So, we went for it and it's
been an unforgettable year.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:28.960
It's been really amazing.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:29.793
- That's really cool.

00:01:29.793 --> 00:01:32.300
Like not only, I get the
fans are excited about it,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.730
but it's way more cool
for you and your family.

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:35.563
That's a hard thing to like,

00:01:35.563 --> 00:01:37.830
I mean that's my road family over there,

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.780
and it's hard to all be
together all the time.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.570
Especially when you're related
I can't even imagine that.

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:42.926
So that's really cool that this ended--

00:01:42.926 --> 00:01:44.090
- It's really special to
share that with family.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:45.050
- If the documentary,

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:45.883
would you have released it

00:01:45.883 --> 00:01:47.130
if y'all wouldn't have gotten together?

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:47.963
- I think so.

00:01:47.963 --> 00:01:50.479
I think, yeah, we had spent
money making it so we probably--

00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:51.760
(laughing)

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.401
- You're like, "Yep."

00:01:53.401 --> 00:01:55.470
- And I think it was an
important story to tell,

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.558
you know and that was kind
of the thing that to us

00:01:57.558 --> 00:02:00.238
was so special about it
is there was no intention

00:02:00.238 --> 00:02:02.150
to come back and do this
again at the beginning

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:04.690
but when we actually just sat
down and did the hard work.

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:05.930
You know most families have to do,

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:07.541
we all go through things
with the people we love.

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:09.601
Whether it's the family you
choose or it's your blood.

00:02:09.601 --> 00:02:10.670
- It's usually the ones you love the most.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.270
- Yeah, you gotta go through it.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:13.953
And we did.

00:02:13.953 --> 00:02:15.000
You know, we look at the other side

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.790
and we're all kind of in the
best place in our lives--

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.623
- I know, you're all married now!

00:02:18.623 --> 00:02:19.477
- All married.

00:02:19.477 --> 00:02:22.470
Brother's got two kids
and it's a beautiful time.

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.868
To have been able to go
through that with your family

00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:26.850
is I think we're all really grateful

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:30.320
and aware of how unique it is
so, it's just been special.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:31.153
- So cool.

00:02:31.153 --> 00:02:34.817
I will say, you have like
the most famous family ever.

00:02:34.817 --> 00:02:35.729
(laughing)

00:02:35.729 --> 00:02:38.190
I was like looking at everyone listed

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.236
in your family tree, I'm like

00:02:39.236 --> 00:02:40.213
(mumbles)

00:02:40.213 --> 00:02:42.200
Those kids are gonna be, like,

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.687
they're not gonna know what normal is.

00:02:43.687 --> 00:02:47.346
- They're gonna have some
cool aunts and cool uncles.

00:02:47.346 --> 00:02:48.179
- It's amazing!

00:02:48.179 --> 00:02:49.012
You all should have, you shouldn't,

00:02:49.012 --> 00:02:50.430
but you should have a reality show.

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:51.587
I just wanna see it.

00:02:51.587 --> 00:02:53.860
I just wanna watch the dynamic

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.190
of all those famous people
in one family, that's insane.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.360
- I think the band might break up again

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.360
if we have a reality show.

